見頂，指數缺乏第二個引擎接手。","so_what":"只買指數會拿到 8 月漲幅的六分之一，但直接加碼記憶體要面對它已站在近兩年分位頂端的事實。合理做法是把記憶體部位的停利條件綁在現貨報價而非股價，並用已經跟上的下游分散單一環節風險。","watch":["南亞科 8 月以來漲幅跌破 +30%（現 +42.0%），代表集中度開始鬆動","台積電 8 月以來由負轉正，指數才有第二個引擎","DDR4 16Gb 現貨均價跌破 80 美元"],"tags":["台股","記憶體","GDP","集中度","南亞科"],"files":{"png":"charts/2026-08-15/04-taiwan-growth-narrow.png","svg":"charts/2026-08-15/04-taiwan-growth-narrow.svg"},"option":{"animation":false,"grid":{"left":92,"right":40,"top":34,"bottom":46},"tooltip":{"trigger":"item"},"color":["#D70C18","#1F4E79","#8A8F95","#B8BBBE"],"textStyle":{"fontFamily":"'Noto Sans TC','PingFang TC',sans-serif"},"xAxis":{"type":"category","data":["單日","近五日","8 月以來"],"axisLine":{"lineStyle":{"color":"#C9C5C0"}},"axisLabel":{"color":"#6B7076"},"splitArea":{"show":false}},"yAxis":{"type":"category","data":["元太","華邦電","南亞科","廣達","鴻海","台積電","加權指數"],"axisLine":{"lineStyle":{"color":"#C9C5C0"}},"axisLabel":{"color":"#6B7076"}},"series":[{"type":"heatmap","data":[{"value":[0,6,-0.46],"itemStyle":{"color":"#EEEDEB"},"label":{"color":"#14161A"}},{"value":[1,6,3.58],"itemStyle":{"color":"#EEDCDA"},"label":{"color":"#14161A"}},{"value":[2,6,6.24],"itemStyle":{"color":"#ECCDCD"},"label":{"color":"#14161A"}},{"value":[0,5,-1.64],"itemStyle":{"color":"#E8E9E8"},"label":{"color":"#14161A"}},{"value":[1,5,1.05],"itemStyle":{"color":"#EFE9E7"},"label":{"color":"#14161A"}},{"value":[2,5,-1.24],"itemStyle":{"color":"#EAEAE9"},"label":{"color":"#14161A"}},{"value":[0,4,-0.95],"itemStyle":{"color":"#EBEBE9"},"label":{"color":"#14161A"}},{"value":[1,4,-0.19],"itemStyle":{"color":"#EFEEEB"},"label":{"color":"#14161A"}},{"value":[2,4,3.59],"itemStyle":{"color":"#EEDCDA"},"label":{"color":"#14161A"}},{"value":[0,3,0.77],"itemStyle":{"color":"#F0EBE8"},"label":{"color":"#14161A"}},{"value":[1,3,9.9],"itemStyle":{"color":"#EABABA"},"label":{"color":"#14161A"}},{"value":[2,3,12.35],"itemStyle":{"color":"#E9ACAE"},"label":{"color":"#14161A"}},{"value":[0,2,-0.39],"itemStyle":{"color":"#EEEEEB"},"label":{"color